# AI-agent workflow/internal files (2026-09-04 user rule): kept and
# actively maintained locally (session logs, agent instructions, research
# notes), but never shipped to a public clone. `git rm --cached` untracks
# an already-committed file without touching it on disk -- these entries
# only stop them from being re-added, they don't delete anything here.
